---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material included in this theme
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Coloured system logos (_inc/systems/logos/, most files)
   From the "Carbon" theme by Rookervik, based on "Simple" by Nils Bonenberger,
   Batocera edition maintained by Fabrice Caruso
   https://github.com/fabricecaruso/es-theme-carbon
   Licence: Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 2.0
   Changes: copied unmodified; the white "-w" variants were not included.

1b. Fallback system logos (_inc/systems/logos/, systems Carbon does not
   cover) and help-prompt icons (_inc/images/help-*.svg)
   From "Art Book Next" by Anthony Caccese
   https://github.com/anthonycaccese/art-book-next-es
   Licence: Creative Commons BY-NC-SA
   Changes: the white fills and strokes of the fallback logos were recoloured
   to dark grey (#4A4A4A) so they show on white tiles.

2. Gamepad activity icon (_inc/images/gamepad.svg)
   From "es-theme-minimal" by lilbud and Fabrice Caruso
   https://github.com/fabricecaruso/es-theme-minimal
   Licence: Creative Commons BY-NC-SA

3. Fonts
   - Varela Round (_inc/fonts/VarelaRound-Regular.ttf)
     Copyright Joe Prince. Licence: Apache License 2.0
     https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
   - Nunito (_inc/fonts/Nunito-Regular.ttf, Nunito-Bold.ttf)
     Copyright The Nunito Project Authors. Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1
     https://openfontlicense.org

Structural ideas were also taken from "PlayStation-X" by pajarorrojo
(https://github.com/pajarorrojo/es-theme-PlayStation-X, CC BY-NC-SA); no files
from that theme are included.

All other artwork in _inc/images was created for this theme by Dan Lee.

4. Background music loop (_music/batwiicera-menu-loop.ogg)
   Supplied by Dan Lee for this theme and distributed under the theme licence
   (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

